    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.base16\n\n### Description\n\nFirst of all, thanks a lot for mini.base16 it is really awesome. This is just a request to optionally include support for Italic and Bold (disable by default). I think this might help further to differentiate some sections that otherwise might have the same color.",
